# Officer and contact forms

Keep `/compose/` and `/update/` **out of** `header_pages`. Do not add `description:` for SEO on those two (see `site-seo.mdc`). Secrets stay in Make or the typed password field (`public-site-secrets.mdc`).

## Endpoints (do not swap)

| Page | `form action` | Auth |
|---|---|---|
| `/compose/` | Make compose webhook already in `compose.html` | `secret` = `COMPOSE_SECRET` in Make |
| `/update/` | Make **update** webhook already in `update.html` | `secret` = `UPLOAD_SECRET` in Make |
| `/contact/` | FormSubmit URL already in `contact.html` | Honey pot only |

Do not reuse the compose hook on `/update/`, the update hook on compose, or either hook for Instagram RSS. Do not point Contact at Make. Scholarships stay on Jotform (`_includes/jotform.html`).

Make responds with 302 to `/compose/thanks/`, `/compose/error/`, `/update/thanks/`, `/update/error/`. Keep those permalinks.

## Concessions (Make + Sheet)

Do **not** reuse compose, update, or contact endpoints. Officers add nights on the **Events** tab; volunteers land on **Signups**. Never commit volunteer names or emails.

Events tab / `_data/concessions-events.csv` headers:

`slug,title,sport,date,start,end,venue,roster_need,published,notes,roster_filled,spots_left`

- `venue` is `stadium` or `gym` (officer station lists live in `_data/concessions.yml`; do not list stations on the public events table or signup form)
- `roster_need` is the slot total (stadium `9`, gym `6`). Closed when Signups `people` reach `roster_need`.
- `roster_filled` / `spots_left` are sheet formulas, not typed. Publish after each signup/cancel so `/concessions-events/` spots left stay current.
- `date` is `YYYY-MM-DD`; `published` is `true` to show on `/concessions-events/`
- Volunteers do **not** pick a station at signup. Stations are assigned on arrival. No password on volunteer signup.

Signups tab (private sheet; never commit names or emails):

`timestamp,event_slug,adult_name,students,email,phone,comment,consent,people,token,action,adult,student_names`

- `adult_name` is the person filling the form (student or adult). `adult` is `true`/`false`.
- Extra people are extra form lines. `student_names` is one name per line (`Name (adult)` if that extra person is an adult). `students` is that extra-line count. `people` is everyone on the signup.
- Volunteer self-cancel uses `/events/concessions-cancel/?token=` and appends `action=cancel` with **negative** `people` (do not delete the original row).
- `roster_filled` is `SUMIF` of Signups `people` for that `event_slug`.

Signup form fields:

`action, event_slug, event_title, adult_name, adult, students, student_names, people, email, phone, comment` plus honeypot `company`. `event_title` is for the confirmation email only — do not add it to the Signups sheet.

Cancel form fields:

`action, token` plus honeypot `company`

Webhook: concessions signup hook already in `events-concessions-signup.html`; cancel uses the dedicated cancel hook in `events-concessions-cancel.html`. Do **not** reuse compose, update, or contact endpoints. No password on volunteer signup. Officers add nights on the private Events tab; compose/update keep their own secrets. 302 to `/events/concessions-thanks/` (`?token=` after signup, `?status=cancelled` after cancel) or `/events/concessions-error/`. After a successful signup, Make emails the cancel URL from Boosters Gmail to the volunteer `email` (Ignore send errors so the roster row and spots publish still complete). Reject new signups when the night is closed. Keep `/events/concessions-signup/` and `/events/concessions-cancel/` out of `header_pages`. The public list is `/concessions-events/` (`concessions-events.html` in `header_pages`).

## Compose (`assets/js/compose-crop.js`)

Browser crops/converts photos. Make must **not** re-crop, convert JPEGs, or remux the MP4.

- Live path: one photo (`image`, 1080×1350), carousel (`images`, 2–10 at 1080×1080), or reel (`video` MP4 as-is). Do not Graph-post, and do not create a Meta developer app. Do not use PhotoPrism for reels.
- One photo: RSS on `https://timberlineblazerboosters.org/feed.xml` uses the existing Facebook connection (Page + Instagram).
- Carousel: compose posts Instagram with `CreateCarouselPhoto` after the JPEGs are on the site. RSS still posts the Facebook link and skips Instagram (`carousel` tag).
- Reel: no `_posts` markdown. Commit a unique `assets/videos/compose-reel-{timestamp}.mp4`, Facebook `uploadAReel` from the webhook file, wait for Pages, Instagram `CreateAReelPost` from that public URL, then **DELETE** the GitHub file. Do not overwrite a shared filename. Do not remux.
- `website_only=1` applies to photo posts only (tag `website-only`). Duplicate photo title the same day → change the title; do not overwrite.
- Do not finish the unused Graph HTTP scenario. Do not point `/compose/` at that webhook.

## Update lists

Each upload **replaces** the whole CSV. `kind=donors` → `_data/donors.csv`; `kind=members` → `_data/members.csv`.

Make redacts last names to an initial. Required headers: donors `first_name,last_name,amount`; members `first_name,last_name,membership_type`. Do not add columns that would publish full last names or emails.
